# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# drafting/: the process is in git, the drafted chapters are not.
# See drafting/REPLICATE.md for how the chapters are rebuilt from what is here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bring back the process data hidden by the global *.json / *.jsonl / *.txt
# rules: configs' evidence packs, the evidence index and log, recorded
# judgments, ledgers, overrides, image-store manifests.
!drafting/**/*.json
!drafting/**/*.jsonl
!drafting/**/*.txt
# The drafted chapter text: section files, stitched chapters, chapter drafts,
# footnoted drafts (and their sidecars), calibration-round paragraphs, and the
# intermediate stitch/verify/polish copies. Patterns are narrow on purpose:
# git here matches case-insensitively, so a bare *draft* would also drop
# DRAFTING_PROGRESS.md, _pipe/draft.py and the editorial outline drafts.
# The per-draft *_report.md files are process records and stay in.
drafting/run/ch*/
drafting/ch[0-9][0-9]_*.md
drafting/ch*/ch*_draft_v*.md
!drafting/ch*/ch*_draft_v*_report.md
drafting/**/*_footnoted.md
drafting/**/*_footnoted.*.json
drafting/editorial/round*/
drafting/**/*_prestitch.md
drafting/**/*_preverify.md
drafting/**/*_polished_raw.md
drafting/ch*/v*_sections/
drafting/ch*/section_*.md
drafting/run/_combined_input.md
# Run state written by the paid/judged pipeline passes; it embeds drafted
# sentences and is regenerated by any rerun.
drafting/ch*/judge_*.json
drafting/ch*/*state*.json
drafting/ch*/*verification*.json
drafting/ch*/*reverify*.json
drafting/ch*/*estimate*.json
drafting/run/state*.json
drafting/run/status*.json
drafting/run/inhouse_state.json
drafting/run/preflight.json
drafting/run/outputs.json
drafting/run/summary_data.json
drafting/run/T0.txt
# Retrieval output regenerated by _tools/retrieve_all.py
drafting/_runs/candidates*.jsonl
# Copy of Tesseract's own config files (comes with the Tesseract install)
drafting/image_store*/_tools/tessdata/
# Stray empty file from a mistyped shell redirect
drafting/holebook*
# Generated, superseded or local-only material.
drafting/_archive/
drafting/run_1_failed_*/
drafting/run/cache/
drafting/run/*.log
drafting/run/*.review_started
drafting/run/*.ready
drafting/_runs/packets/
drafting/_runs/*_log.jsonl
drafting/**/candidates*/
drafting/_tools/vendor/
drafting/image_store*/_work/
drafting/image_store*/for_drive/
drafting/image_store*/plates/
drafting/image_store*/rectified/
drafting/image_store*/images/

